></div></div></a></div><div data-target=\"withTab.attr.guide\" data-index=\"1\" class=\"obc-tmpl__article\"><!----></div></div></li><li data-target=\"withTab.attr\" data-index=\"1\" class=\"obc-tmpl__switch-item\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl-article__row\"><div data-target=\"withTab.attr.guide\" data-index=\"0\" class=\"obc-tmpl__article\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.miyoushe.com/bh3/article/31321619\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl__article-container\"><img src=\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2025/05/28/76321978/0824b847411e1ea719e91159dc46724b_6211118170899115739.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"obc-tmpl__icon\"> <div class=\"obc-tmpl__article-text\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl__article-text-title\">记忆战场阵容搭配&amp;实战合集【持续更新至20250429】</div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl__article-text-summary\">本帖将会对记忆战场的阵容搭配和实战参考进行整合，点击标题或卡片即可进入对应的帖子中浏览内容，各位舰长可以根据自身的需求来寻找所需内容~</div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl__article-text-info\"><span class=\"obc-tmpl__article-text-info-author\"><img src=\"https://bbs-static.miyoushe.com/communityweb/upload/6726c4c896d767d616f77d37b8072ff5.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"author-avatar\"> <span>猫小火火</span></span> <span><span class=\"create-time-prefix\">发表时间：</span>2022-11-08 21:44</span></div></div></div></a></div><div data-target=\"withTab.attr.guide\" data-index=\"1\" class=\"obc-tmpl__article\"><!----></div></div></li><li data-target=\"withTab.attr\" data-index=\"2\" class=\"obc-tmpl__switch-item\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl-article__row\"><div data-target=\"withTab.attr.guide\" data-index=\"0\" class=\"obc-tmpl__article\"><!----></div></div></li></ul> <!----></div></div></div></div></div> <div data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"detail__body-endpart\"><hr data-v-f0365338=\"\"> <p data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"detail__copyright\"><img data-v-f0365338=\"\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\">\n        词条内容由圣芙蕾雅档案馆编辑团队原创，禁止转载\n      </p></div> <!---->",
